  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W42",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周先驱有不少新科技，牺牲类套牌每周都有新花样。最开始是铁砧套牌中加入了标准的神器牺牲组件，然后是猫炉红黑牺牲套牌混绿加入[[card:Biotech Specialist|生质科技专家]]，本周开始出现黑绿牺牲混红带[[card:Biotech Specialist|生质科技专家]]的版本拿下一个亚军：deck:72783f790d2a68dcff03。两者虽然都归类为勇德牺牲，但构筑还是有一些差别。而铁砧版本的神器牺牲几乎已经迅速被环境淘汰。",
          "en": "Pioneer saw plenty of new technology this week, with Sacrifice decks finding new twists every week. First, Anvil decks added the artifact sacrifice package from Standard. Then Rakdos Sacrifice decks built around [[card:Cauldron Familiar|Cauldron Familiar]] and [[card:Witch's Oven|Witch's Oven]] splashed green for [[card:Biotech Specialist|Biotech Specialist]]. This week, a Golgari Sacrifice build splashing red for [[card:Biotech Specialist|Biotech Specialist]] finished second: deck:72783f790d2a68dcff03. Although both builds are classified as Jund Sacrifice, their construction differs somewhat. Meanwhile, Anvil-based artifact sacrifice decks have already all but disappeared from the metagame."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:72783f790d2a68dcff03",
            "label": {
              "zh": "勇得牺牲 · GhostbloodGhost · 第2名",
              "en": "Jund Sacrifice · GhostbloodGhost · Rank 2"
            },
            "deck": {
