              "player": "GhostbloodGhost",
              "final_rank": 2,
              "starttime": "2026-10-17 22:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "加入[[card:Hexhaven Invigorator|赫克海文茁茂兽]]的大绿献力本周席卷一场：deck:bcf6e21ae6eb7db34a4d。不光自己可以提供4点献力，还可以配合满编的[[card:Tail Swipe|甩尾扫击]]互斗找地Ramp，迅速出[[card:Craterhoof Behemoth|陨蹄贝西摩斯]]终结比赛。另外还有传统的[[card:Leyline of the Guildpact|十会盟地脉]]版本大绿献力取得四强：deck:48cb9b5b7dbea4a2216b",
          "en": "Mono-Green Devotion featuring [[card:Hexhaven Invigorator|Hexhaven Invigorator]] swept an event this week: deck:bcf6e21ae6eb7db34a4d. The Invigorator not only provides four devotion itself, but also works with a full playset of [[card:Tail Swipe|Tail Swipe]] to fight creatures and find lands, ramping quickly into [[card:Craterhoof Behemoth|Craterhoof Behemoth]] to end the game. A traditional [[card:Leyline of the Guildpact|Leyline of the Guildpact]] build of Mono-Green Devotion also reached the semifinals: deck:48cb9b5b7dbea4a2216b"
        },
