      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "[[card:The Theorist, Jace Beleren|塑理师杰斯贝连]]进入环境后，红蓝创新开始有上升趋势，本周席卷一场，八强占比也超过10%：deck:66772f50230d29dcc0ce。杰斯造人抓牌控场的效果相当契合套牌思路。",
          "en": "Izzet Creativity has been on the rise since [[card:The Theorist, Jace Beleren|The Theorist, Jace Beleren]] entered the format. It swept an event this week and exceeded a 10% Top 8 share: deck:66772f50230d29dcc0ce. Jace's ability to make tokens, draw cards, and control the board fits the deck's game plan very well."
        },
